  "sign.guhs.einde2_bouw_zij2.vierde_guh": "(fourth guh:",
  "sign.guhs.einde2_bouw_zij2.ook_knap_njeg": "nice too, nyeg)",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.section.extra_einde2_bouw_zij2": "Harbor, Village and Library",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_leegtehaven.title": "Find the Void Harbor",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_leegtehaven.desc": "Somewhere between the outer islands a whole &6harbor&r floats in the nothing: jetties with Grease Ships moored to them, a market with Ender Mikas behind the stalls, a ferry pier, a shipyard and a pub. The Super Compass (the End tab) shows the way. Land on the deck with the little pink nose.",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_kyoshi_dorp.title": "Find Kyoshi Village",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_kyoshi_dorp.desc": "Above the Blue Cheese Plains floats a village with sea-green roofs, and towering over it all is a &6giant statue of Kyoshi Guh&r: white face paint, golden fans, very big feet. There is a dance floor in the dojo. The warrior guhs must have just stepped out, nyeg.",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_bibliotheek_wan_shi_guh.title": "Find Wan Shi Guh's Library",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_bibliotheek_wan_shi_guh.desc": "In the Rind Desert a green spire sticks out of the sand. That is all you see. The rest of the &6library&r hangs underneath: six halls deep, full of books. The entrance is the window. Really.",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_leeuwschildpad_eiland.title": "Find Lion Turtle Island",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_leeuwschildpad_eiland.desc": "An island with a forest on it. And a tail. And a head with a mane and guh ears. This island &6is someone&r: a Lion Turtle Guh, so old he forgot how old. Walk along his arm to the palm of his hand and say hello nicely.",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_guhvleugel_ringenrace.title": "Find the Guh Wing Ring Race",
  "ftb.guhs_guheinde.q.einde2_bouw_zij2_guhvleugel_ringenrace.desc": "In the Crumb Clouds hangs a course of &6eighteen glowing rings&r: out along the north side, around the turn, back along the south side. Start tower, landing strip, scoreboard: all set. Only the race master has yet to show up. Practicing is allowed."
}
